      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That makes sense. I want to sound authoritative but not too aggressive yet—I don't want them to shut me down immediately. I'm thinking of using something like \"Notice of Formal Assertion of Sovereign Succession.\" \n\nDo you think I should include a section regarding the specific diplomatic immunity protections that would apply to a recognized head of a sovereign house under international law? I want them to understand that I'm not just some person making a claim, but a representative of a continuous legal entity.",
